8068:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c **** /**
8069:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @brief  Configures the TIMx External Trigger (ETR).
8070:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIMx to select the TIM peripheral
8071:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIM_ExtTRGPrescaler The external Trigger Prescaler.
